        "basic_text_LjqQUE": {
          "type": "basic_text",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Everything changed when I attended an e-commerce summit and met Marcus Rodriguez, a conversion optimization expert who'd helped 500+ stores scale past 8 figures. He noticed me checking my analytics during his presentation—another day of high traffic but disappointing conversions.</p><p>After his session, he approached me and said, <strong>\"You know, most conversion problems aren't actually traffic problems—they're user experience problems.\"</strong></p><p>\"What do you mean?\" I asked, intrigued.</p><p>\"Your store has visitors, but your theme is fighting against conversions,\" he explained. \"Your cart doesn't build urgency, your product pages don't leverage social proof properly, and you're missing critical micro-conversions throughout the buyer journey. You need a theme built from the ground up for CRO.\"</p><p>He then showed me something that would revolutionize my understanding of Shopify themes: <strong>the EcomElevate CRO-Optimized Theme from ecomelevate.co</strong>.</p><p><strong>That conversation completely changed my perspective on e-commerce design.</strong></p>",
            "highlighted_texts": "",
            "highlight_texts_color": "#19bdff",
            "image_position": "above",
            "image_width": 100,
            "padding_top": 0,
            "padding_bottom": 0,
            "padding_left": 0,
            "padding_right": 0
          }
        },
        "heading_fTRtwU": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "tag": "h2",
