        "basic_text_HeTDtH": {
          "type": "basic_text",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>What Marcus taught me was eye-opening. <strong>Most Shopify themes only focus on aesthetics, not the underlying psychological triggers that drive purchases.</strong></p><p>Here's what actually happens with low conversions: Visitors land on your store but don't see social proof, don't feel urgency, and don't have their objections addressed. They bounce without buying, and you blame your traffic quality or pricing—but it's actually your theme's fault.</p><p><strong>Your store wasn't failing—it was stuck in a conversion trap.</strong> Generic themes look pretty but don't convert, expensive apps add features but slow down your site, and nothing was systematically optimizing every step of the buyer journey.</p><p>The EcomElevate theme works differently. It integrates 123+ conversion-optimized sections—quantity breaks, smart cart drawer with upsells, bundle deals, progress bars, trust badges, urgency timers, social proof displays, and comparison sliders—all working together to guide visitors toward purchase.</p><p><strong>It's not about looking pretty—it's about maximizing every micro-conversion opportunity.</strong></p>",
            "highlighted_texts": "Most Shopify themes only focus on aesthetics, not the underlying psychological triggers that drive purchases|Your store wasn't failing—it was stuck in a conversion trap",
            "highlight_texts_color": "#e8f5e8",
