        "basic_text_Yt7iN9": {
          "type": "basic_text",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>I wanted something conversion-focused after years of trying themes that looked beautiful but delivered disappointing sales. That's exactly what I found with the <strong>EcomElevate CRO-Optimized Shopify Theme from ecomelevate.co</strong>.</p><p>Here's why it crushed my revenue goals when nothing else had:</p><p>✓ <strong>123+ Pre-Built CRO Sections</strong> – Every section engineered specifically to increase conversions and AOV.</p><p>✓ <strong>Smart Cart Drawer Optimization</strong> – Built-in upsells, quantity breaks, progress bars, and urgency triggers that increased my cart value by 89%.</p><p>✓ <strong>Quantity Break System</strong> – Native tiered pricing that encourages bulk purchases without clunky apps.</p><p>✓ <strong>Bundle Deal Engine</strong> – Create irresistible product bundles that boost AOV effortlessly.</p><p>✓ <strong>Zero App Dependencies</strong> – Everything built natively for lightning-fast load times and better SEO.</p><p>✓ <strong>Mobile-First Design</strong> – Converts on every device, especially mobile where 70%+ of traffic comes from.</p>",
