        "basic_text_qadaVG": {
          "type": "basic_text",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Let me be transparent—I had spent a fortune. Multiple Shopify apps at $29-99/month each, custom Liquid development at $150/hour, freelance designers, premium page builders. Most either slowed down my store or delivered mediocre results that didn't justify the cost.</p><p>Here's what makes the EcomElevate theme completely different:</p><p>✓ <strong>Holistic CRO Approach</strong> – Every element works together systematically to guide visitors toward purchase.</p><p>✓ <strong>Performance-First Architecture</strong> – Lightning-fast load times (90+ PageSpeed scores) because conversions drop 7% for every 1-second delay.</p><p>✓ <strong>Built-In Social Proof</strong> – Reviews integration, trust badges, live visitor counts, and recent purchase notifications that build credibility.</p><p>✓ <strong>Advertorial Page Builder</strong> – Create high-converting VSL and advertorial pages like this one without any coding.</p><p>✓ <strong>Battle-Tested Sections</strong> – Every section has been A/B tested across thousands of stores for maximum performance.</p><p>✓ <strong>One-Time Investment</strong> – No monthly app fees bleeding your profit margins. Get multiple licenses at ecomelevate.co.</p><p><strong>This isn't just another theme—it's a complete revenue optimization system.</strong></p>",
            "highlighted_texts": "",
