        "basic_text_7cypEJ": {
          "type": "basic_text",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>The revenue results speak for themselves. Store owners across the globe are finally breaking through their conversion barriers:</p><p><strong>\"I was stuck at $8K/month for 18 months. Switched to EcomElevate and hit $31K in my second month. The cart drawer optimization alone increased my AOV by 94%. The quantity breaks feature got customers buying in bulk without me having to push them.\"</strong><br/><em>- Sarah K., Beauty & Skincare Store</em></p><p><strong>\"As a dropshipper, every app fee cut into my margins. This theme eliminated $387/month in app subscriptions while INCREASING my conversion rate from 1.8% to 4.2%. The built-in bundle deals section is pure gold.\"</strong><br/><em>- Marcus T., Electronics Store</em></p><p><strong>\"I was about to hire an expensive developer to build custom cart features. Found EcomElevate instead and it had everything I needed built-in. Saved me $6,500 and launched in 2 days instead of 6 weeks. My cart abandonment dropped from 76% to 51%.\"</strong><br/><em>- Jennifer L., Fashion Boutique</em></p><p><strong>\"Bought 3 more licenses from ecomelevate.co for my other stores. Best investment I've made in my e-commerce career. Every store is now converting 3X better than before.\"</strong><br/><em>- David R., Multi-Store Owner</em></p>",
