        "basic_text_XwMyhV": {
          "type": "basic_text",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>From the moment you install <strong>EcomElevate CRO-Optimized Theme</strong>, you'll experience the comprehensive conversion optimization your store desperately needs:</p><p>✓ <strong>Immediate Conversion Boost</strong> – 89% of stores see improved conversion rates within the first 7 days.</p><p>✓ <strong>Increased AOV</strong> – Smart cart features and quantity breaks typically increase average order value by 60-120%.</p><p>✓ <strong>Reduced Cart Abandonment</strong> – Optimized cart drawer with urgency triggers drops abandonment by 25-40%.</p><p>✓ <strong>Better Mobile Performance</strong> – Mobile conversions improve by an average of 78% thanks to mobile-first design.</p><p>✓ <strong>Long-Term Growth</strong> – Build a sustainable, high-converting store that scales with your business.</p><p>✓ <strong>Multiple Store Licenses</strong> – Need more licenses? Get them at ecomelevate.co and scale your entire portfolio.</p><p><strong>Just one theme installation</strong> is all it takes to <strong>transform your store into a conversion machine</strong>!</p>",
