        "listicle_item_w6Ej3J": {
          "type": "listicle_item",
          "settings": {
            "enable_container": false,
            "hide_image": true,
            "title": "1. 50+ Professionally Designed Sections That Actually Convert",
            "content": "<p>Unlike other themes with limited, cookie-cutter sections, EcomElevate gives you <strong>over 50 unique, conversion-optimized sections</strong> designed by e-commerce experts. From stunning hero banners and feature cards to advanced comparison tables and testimonial sliders — every section is crafted to turn visitors into customers. <strong>No more settling for \"good enough\" when you can have exceptional.</strong></p>",
