          "settings": {
            "enable_container": false,
            "hide_image": false,
            "title": "2. Built-In Advertorial & Listicle Pages That Print Money",
            "content": "<p>Stop paying for expensive landing page builders! EcomElevate includes <strong>professional advertorial and listicle templates</strong> right out of the box. Create high-converting editorial-style pages that build trust and drive sales — the same format used by 8-figure DTC brands. <strong>This feature alone is worth more than the entire theme price.</strong></p>",
            "highlight_text": "",
