        "listicle_item_FNreDU": {
          "type": "listicle_item",
          "settings": {
            "enable_container": false,
            "hide_image": false,
            "title": "3. Pixel-Perfect Customization Without Writing Code",
            "content": "<p>Every single element is customizable. <strong>Font sizes, colors, spacing, borders, gradients</strong> — you control it all from the theme editor. Want that heading 2px bigger? Done. Need custom padding on mobile? Easy. EcomElevate gives you designer-level control without touching a single line of code. <strong>Your vision, perfectly executed.</strong></p>",
