          "type": "listicle_item",
          "settings": {
            "enable_container": false,
            "hide_image": false,
            "title": "4. Lightning-Fast Performance That Boosts SEO & Conversions",
            "content": "<p>Speed kills (your competition). EcomElevate is built with <strong>clean, optimized code that loads blazing fast.</strong> Better page speed means higher Google rankings, lower bounce rates, and more conversions. While other themes bloat your store with unnecessary code, EcomElevate keeps things lean and mean. <strong>Your customers won't wait — and now they won't have to.</strong></p>",
