            "hide_image": false,
            "title": "5. Mobile-First Design That Captures Every Sale",
            "content": "<p>Over 70% of e-commerce traffic comes from mobile. EcomElevate is designed <strong>mobile-first from the ground up</strong> with separate controls for mobile, tablet, and desktop. Every section looks stunning and converts beautifully on any device. <strong>Stop losing mobile customers to poorly optimized themes.</strong></p>",
