          "settings": {
            "enable_container": false,
            "hide_image": false,
            "title": "6. Advanced Product Page Features That Sell For You",
            "content": "<p><strong><em>Editor's Note: This is where EcomElevate truly shines!</em></strong> Benefit pills, icon features, quantity breaks, variant pickers with swatches, sticky add-to-cart, and so much more. Every element is designed to overcome objections and drive purchases. Your product pages will look like they cost $10,000 to build — but they're included free with the theme.</p>",
