            "title": "7. Us vs Them Comparison Tables That Crush Competitors",
            "content": "<p>Show customers exactly why you're the best choice. The built-in <strong>comparison table section</strong> lets you highlight your advantages over competitors in a visually stunning format. Customizable icons, colors, and layouts make it easy to communicate your value proposition instantly. <strong>Turn fence-sitters into buyers with powerful visual comparisons.</strong></p>",
